  "label": "Financial Greed/Control Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme may also implicitly reference the antisemitic stereotype that Jews control global finance and media — a long-standing antisemitic trope used to justify persecution. The phrase 'well done please!' could be interpreted as a mocking acknowledgment of this stereotype, suggesting that the victims were 'done' because they were perceived as 'greedy' or 'controlling', which is a form of antisemitic dehumanization.",
